<title>GERMANY: German farm coops demand EU milk reform proposals.</title>
<headline>German farm coops demand EU milk reform proposals.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>German farm cooperatives organisation DRV called on the European Union Commission and EU farm ministers to generate proposals and decisions on the future milk market regime as soon as possible.</p>
<p>A DRV statement, issued ahead of the organisation's annual meeting on Wednesday, said markets were waiting to hear about likely solutions soon, in order to plan ahead.</p>
<p>National quotas are due to expire in March 2000.</p>
</text>
